## Usage

```hcl
module "{{ .Name }}" {
  source = "{{ .Values.source | default (printf "./modules/%s" .Name) }}"

  name_prefix = "{{ .Values.namePrefix | default "acme" }}"
  environment = "dev"

  tags = {
    Owner = "{{ .Values.owner | default .User }}"
  }
}
```

